{"seq":3,"slug":"alert-triage-false-positive","title":"告警处置与误报管理：队列分诊、阈值调优与工单闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-sanctions-denied-party-screening/denied-party-screening-engineering/alert-triage-false-positive","wordCount":2914,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"告警处置与误报管理-队列分诊-阈值调优与工单闭环\">告警处置与误报管理：队列分诊、阈值调优与工单闭环</h1><p>筛查引擎每天从几十万笔订单里挑出几千条「疑似命中」，其中 95% 以上在人工核查后都被放行——这不是系统烂，而是受限方筛查的<strong>结构性特征</strong>：名单侧姓名高度重复（<code>Mohammed Ali</code>、<code>Li Wei</code> 在名单上各出现几百次），而匹配算法必须优先保召回。真正的工程分水岭不在「匹配得多准」，而在<strong>告警进来之后怎么办</strong>：怎么排优先级、什么时候调整阈值、工单怎么判定与归档、判定结果如何回流成下一轮的调参依据。本篇给出这套处置闭环的 2026 年生产做法，与同 hub 的<a href=\"name-matching-algorithms\">名称与实体匹配算法</a>（负责「怎么算分」）衔接成本篇负责的「分进来之后怎么处置」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-误报是阈值经济学的必然产物-不是缺陷\">核心概念：误报是阈值经济学的必然产物，不是缺陷</h2><p>先把预期摆正。名称匹配在百万级名单上做的是<strong>高召回</strong>设计：只要把相似度下限压得足够低以吞掉真命中，就必然把大量「碰巧同名」的人拖进复核队列。行业里公开讨论的误报率普遍在 <strong>90%–95%+</strong> 区间（各家口径不同，取决于名单规模、业务地域与阈值），这意味着一个日均 2,000 条告警的跨境业务，如果全靠人工硬扛、不做分诊与自动清分，就是每月数万条的人工工时——这是筛查系统运营成本的大头，也是清单式合规审查最喜欢挑的地方——OFAC 的合规承诺框架把「筛查」与「报告」单列为独立控制项（<a href=\"https://ofac.treasury.gov/media/16331/download\">OFAC Framework for Compliance Commitments</a>）。</p>\n<p>把处置设计成一个<strong>最小化期望成本</strong>的问题，比「把误报率降到最低」更贴近现实。令自动命中阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{high}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、自动放行阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{low}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则一个人工复核决策点的期望成本是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[C] = C_{FN}\\cdot P(FN) + C_{FP}\\cdot P(FP) + C_{rev}\\cdot N_{rev}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一次漏放真命中带来的监管罚款、交易作废与声誉损失（对 SDN 命中可达数百万美元量级），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一次误报带来的客户摩擦与交易延迟，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{rev}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是审核一条告警的人工成本。因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≫</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FN} \\gg C_{FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，最优解<strong>永远偏向高召回</strong>：宁可让灰区多吞可疑对子，也不让真命中从下限漏出。阈值调优的本质因此不是「降误报」，而是在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{rev}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之间找平衡点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[筛查引擎输出告警] --&gt; B{匹配分档}&#10;    B --&gt;|&gt;= t_high 自动命中| C[自动冻结交易&lt;br/&gt;进高优工单]&#10;    B --&gt;|t_low ~ t_high 灰区| D[进人工复核队列]&#10;    B --&gt;|&lt; t_low 自动放行| E[不入队 记录留痕]&#10;    D --&gt; F[分诊:严重度打分&lt;br/&gt;名单层级/金额/司法辖区/客户风险]&#10;    F --&gt; G{优先级}&#10;    G --&gt;|P1 SDN/制裁核心| H[4 小时内首响]&#10;    G --&gt;|P2 非 SDN 受限方| I[24-48 小时]&#10;    G --&gt;|P3 低风险| J[按容量 FIFO]&#10;    H --&gt; K[分析师核查&lt;br/&gt;名称/地址/证件/交易背景]&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    J --&gt; K&#10;    K --&gt; L{判定}&#10;    L --&gt;|真命中| M[阻断 + 拒单&lt;br/&gt;必要时提交冻结/可疑报告]&#10;    L --&gt;|误报| N[放行 + 记处置码]&#10;    L --&gt;|存疑升级| O[升级至合规官/法务]&#10;    M --&gt; P[工单归档 不可变审计留痕]&#10;    N --&gt; P&#10;    O --&gt; P&#10;    P --&gt; Q[回流:标注集/规则/阈值回归]&#10;    Q --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n    A[筛查引擎输出告警] --&gt; B{匹配分档}\n    B --&gt;|&gt;= t_high 自动命中| C[自动冻结交易&lt;br/&gt;进高优工单]\n    B --&gt;|t_low ~ t_high 灰区| D[进人工复核队列]\n    B --&gt;|&lt; t_low 自动放行| E[不入队 记录留痕]\n    D --&gt; F[分诊:严重度打分&lt;br/&gt;名单层级/金额/司法辖区/客户风险]\n    F --&gt; G{优先级}\n    G --&gt;|P1 SDN/制裁核心| H[4 小时内首响]\n    G --&gt;|P2 非 SDN 受限方| I[24-48 小时]\n    G --&gt;|P3 低风险| J[按容量 FIFO]\n    H --&gt; K[分析师核查&lt;br/&gt;名称/地址/证件/交易背景]\n    I --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K\n    K --&gt; L{判定}\n    L --&gt;|真命中| M[阻断 + 拒单&lt;br/&gt;必要时提交冻结/可疑报告]\n    L --&gt;|误报| N[放行 + 记处置码]\n    L --&gt;|存疑升级| O[升级至合规官/法务]\n    M --&gt; P[工单归档 不可变审计留痕]\n    N --&gt; P\n    O --&gt; P\n    P --&gt; Q[回流:标注集/规则/阈值回归]\n    Q --&gt; B</pre><p>这张图的闭环箭头是关键：<strong>每一次判定都必须是下一次调参的证据</strong>，否则阈值永远停在出厂值、误报率永远停在 95%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"队列分诊-把-先审谁-从-fifo-变成风险排序\">队列分诊：把「先审谁」从 FIFO 变成风险排序</h2><p>最朴素的队列是先进先出，但制裁筛查的告警价值差异极大：一条 SDN 命中与一条「非 SDN 名单上的同名小客户」在后果上不是一个量级。分诊的第一件事是给每条灰区告警打<strong>严重度分</strong>，把有限的分析师注意力投到最危险的那几条上。可用的信号维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分诊维度</th>\n<th>取值示例</th>\n<th>为什么影响优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>名单层级</td>\n<td>SDN / SSI / 非 SDN 观察名单</td>\n<td>SDN 命中直接触发资产冻结义务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匹配分</td>\n<td>落灰区的位置（贴近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{high}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 更危险）</td>\n<td>分越高，真命中后验概率越大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易金额</td>\n<td>单笔 &gt; 阈值 / 高频小额</td>\n<td>金额决定敞口与可疑阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>司法辖区</td>\n<td>高风险国/被制裁地区</td>\n<td>地域本身就是风险乘子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户档案</td>\n<td>新客 / 高风险行业 / PEP 关联</td>\n<td>存量尽调信息可复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效压力</td>\n<td>待发货 / 待付款 / 已收款</td>\n<td>阻断窗口不同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把这些信号合成一个优先级分数，常见做法是<strong>加权的规则打分</strong>或<strong>逻辑回归</strong>，输出映射到 P1/P2/P3 三档，各档绑定不同的首响与处置时限（SLA）。SLA 分档的现实依据是：冻结义务有时效性，而误报核实可以稍等。分诊层要刻意<strong>保留一条人工旁路</strong>——大额、异常、监管关注名单上的告警允许分析师手动提级，避免规则盲区被自动分诊掩盖。</p>\n<p>分诊还承担<strong>队列治理</strong>职责：跟踪积压深度与最老未处置告警的年龄。积压是筛查运营最隐蔽的失效模式——一条 SDN 告警在队列里躺了两周没人碰，等于事实上没有控制。成熟团队会把「最老 P1 告警年龄」当作一级运营指标，而不是只看平均处置时长（平均时长会被大量快速误报拉好看）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈值调优-用成本模型取代-拍脑袋定-0-85\">阈值调优：用成本模型取代「拍脑袋定 0.85」</h2><p>前面匹配篇讲的是双阈值切三段，本篇要回答<strong>阈值定在哪</strong>。三条硬规则：</p>\n<p><strong>其一，阈值只能从标注集上定，不能从直觉定。</strong> 从历史告警中抽样，人工标注「真命中 / 误报」各数百条，构成<strong>地面真值集</strong>；在此之上扫 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{high}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{low}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，画出精确率—召回率曲线与成本曲线。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{high}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 选在「几乎不可能误」的区间（自动命中的误判代价最高，宁缺毋滥），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{low}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 选在「可疑尽量不漏」的区间。用成本函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[C]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 选点，而不是用「平衡准确率」。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，误报率不是越低越好，要连人工成本一起看。</strong> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{low}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 抬高能立刻压掉一批误报，但代价是真命中漏出概率上升；把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{low}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压低能收紧漏放，但灰区膨胀、人工成本上升。正确的目标函数是最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[C]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，这也解释了为什么不同业务的最优阈值不同——高客单价、高风险辖区的业务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 更大，就该用更宽的灰区。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，阈值会因名单漂移而失效，必须定期回归。</strong> OpenSanctions 默认数据集 2026-10-01 版本聚合了 <strong>467 个数据源、约 4,086,607 个实体（其中约 1,232,503 个可筛查 target）</strong>，每 <strong>6 小时</strong>更新一轮（<a href=\"https://www.opensanctions.org/datasets/default/\">OpenSanctions Default Dataset</a>）；OFAC SDN 亦每日增删条目与别名。名单里新增一个常见姓氏别名，就会让原先安全的阈值突然多出一批误报。因此调参不是一次性项目，而是<strong>每次名单更新后重放标注集</strong>的常规回归，配合<a href=\"../sanctions-regimes-lists/list-change-monitoring-delta\">名单变更监控</a>的增量信号触发复审。</p>\n<p>调优的常见误区，是把「提高阈值」当成压误报的万能旋钮。它确实能压自动命中层的误报，却把风险<strong>推给人工层</strong>——如果队列容量不变，结果只是积压。真正的减误报要靠<strong>加证据</strong>：并入地址、证件号、出生日期等字段做联合打分（Fellegi-Sunter 加权），而不是把阈值拧到底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工单闭环-判定-留痕与不可变审计\">工单闭环：判定、留痕与不可变审计</h2><p>告警进队列之后，处置要落到**工单（case）**这个载体上，核心是三样东西：标准化的判定结果、可复核的证据链路、不可篡改的审计留痕。</p>\n<p><strong>判定码（disposition code）标准化。</strong> 每张工单关闭时必须落一个枚举值，供后续统计与回流。常见集合：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处置码</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>后续动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>TRUE_MATCH</code></td>\n<td>确认为同一受限主体</td>\n<td>阻断交易；按辖区义务提交冻结/可疑报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>FALSE_POSITIVE</code></td>\n<td>确认非同一主体</td>\n<td>放行；标注为正样本回流标注集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>POTENTIAL_MATCH</code></td>\n<td>无法排除但证据不足</td>\n<td>升级合规官/法务；暂缓交易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>INSUFFICIENT_INFO</code></td>\n<td>客户资料不足无法判定</td>\n<td>触发 KYC 补件；挂起直至补全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DUPLICATE</code></td>\n<td>与既有工单重复</td>\n<td>合并；避免重复劳动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>四眼原则（four-eyes）与权限隔离。</strong> 放行一条「疑似命中」是高风险决策，成熟做法要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TRUE\\_MATCH</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FALSE\\_POSITIVE</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 的判定由非发起人复核，或对 <code>TRUE_MATCH</code> 的解除冻结设双人审批。这在 OFAC 的合规框架里被归入「独立测试与审计」维度——控制必须可被独立验证。</p>\n<p><strong>留痕与保留期。</strong> 工单的原始告警、匹配字段、分析师判定、审批链、时间戳必须<strong>不可变</strong>保存（append-only 或带哈希链的审计日志），保留期通常按辖区监管要求设定（金融机构常见 5 年，跨境贸易视司法辖区而定）。留痕的关键性质是：事后监管抽查时，你要能证明「当时为什么这么判」，而不是只有一句「已放行」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反馈闭环与运营度量-让每次判定都变成下一次的输入\">反馈闭环与运营度量：让每次判定都变成下一次的输入</h2><p>一个只会开工单、不会回流的处置系统，是纯粹的成本中心。闭环的四个回流路径：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>误报回流标注集</strong>：<code>FALSE_POSITIVE</code> 样本持续喂给标注集，让阈值回归有越来越大的地面真值。</li>\n<li><strong>真命中回流匹配规则</strong>：<code>TRUE_MATCH</code> 的匹配字段组合揭示漏网的相似度模式，用于补分块键或调字段权重。</li>\n<li><strong>升级回流规则</strong>：<code>POTENTIAL_MATCH</code> 的分布暴露匹配规则在某类名字上的系统性缺陷。</li>\n<li><strong>分诊回流</strong>：工单实际耗时与优先级是否成反比，检验分诊模型本身的校准度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>运营度量要盯住这几项：<strong>误报率</strong>（放行占总量，行业常见 90%–95%+）、<strong>自动清分率</strong>（不入队比例）、<strong>平均处置时长与 P1 最老年龄</strong>（队列健康的双指标）、<strong>积压深度</strong>、<strong>重开率</strong>（判定被推翻的比例，衡量质量）、以及<strong>每千笔交易告警数</strong>（衡量筛查规则的信号噪声比）。其中重开率最易被忽略：如果分析师频繁推翻既有判定，说明阈值或规则不稳，工单闭环实际上在漏气。</p>\n<p>最后提醒一个工程陷阱：<strong>别用「误报数」直接驱动调参</strong>。误报数与告警总量、名单规模、业务量都耦合，单看它会把趋势性变化误判成规则退化。要用<strong>归一化指标</strong>（误报率、每千笔告警数）配合标注集回归，才能区分「名单变大了」和「规则真的坏了」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>受限方筛查的高误报（90%–95%+）是高召回设计的<strong>结构性代价</strong>，处置目标不是消灭误报，而是最小化期望成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[C] = C_{FN}\\cdot P(FN) + C_{FP}\\cdot P(FP) + C_{rev}\\cdot N_{rev}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><