n></span></span></span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≫</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FN} \\gg C_{FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，最优解永远偏向高召回。</li>\n<li><strong>分诊</strong>把 FIFO 换成基于名单层级、匹配分、金额、辖区、客户风险的风险排序，P1/P2/P3 绑定时效 SLA，并把「最老 P1 告警年龄」作为一级指标盯积压。</li>\n<li><strong>阈值调优</strong>只能从标注集与成本曲线上定，不能拍脑袋；名单每天在漂移（OpenSanctions 默认集 467 源、约 408 万实体、6 小时一轮），阈值必须随名单更新定期回归。</li>\n<li><strong>工单闭环</strong>靠标准化判定码、四眼审批与不可变留痕三件事落地，判定码是把处置转成可统计证据的接口。</li>\n<li><strong>反馈回流</strong>（误报入标注集、真命中调规则、升级暴露盲区）与归一化运营度量（误报率、自动清分率、重开率、每千笔告警数）共同构成持续改进的引擎；调参要靠加证据而非反复拧阈值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"告警处置与误报管理：队列分诊、阈值调优与工单闭环","id":"告警处置与误报管理-队列分诊-阈值调优与工单闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：误报是阈值经济学的必然产物，不是缺陷","id":"核心概念-误报是阈值经济学的必然产物-不是缺陷"},{"level":2,"text":"队列分诊：把「先审谁」从 FIFO 变成风险排序","id":"队列分诊-把-先审谁-从-fifo-变成风险排序"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值调优：用成本模型取代「拍脑袋定 0.85」","id":"阈值调优-用成本模型取代-拍脑袋定-0-85"},{"level":2,"text":"工单闭环：判定、留痕与不可变审计","id":"工单闭环-判定-留痕与不可变审计"},{"level":2,"text":"反馈闭环与运营度量：让每次判定都变成下一次的输入","id":"反馈闭环与运营度量-让每次判定都变成下一次的输入"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"筛查管线架构：实时/批量接入、缓存与订单客户 KYC 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-sanctions-denied-party-screening/denied-party-screening-engineering/screening-pipeline-architecture"},"next":{"title":"物项分类模型：ECCN、管制清单与管制理由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-sanctions-denied-party-screening/export-control-classification/eccn-classification-model"}}